velocity internals scale 310.0

 fix printCenters all ave/time 100 100000 10000000 c_endForce file out_restrained/timeAvg_sternForces.${dispRatio}.txt
 fix printCenters all ave/time 100 100000 10000000 c_endForce file out_restrained/timeAvg_sternForces.0.01.txt
